audio:
  lang: en
  lines:
    '|a||Time flies in Russian: идёт дождь, тебе идёт':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5200
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Идёт дождь, время летит, тебе идёт: Russian motion verbs where nobody moves, the day Masha comes back from Sochi.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:nrtzdp'
    '|a||Коне́ц ию́ля. Ма́ша верну́лась из пое́здки на мо́ре: ей повезло́ с пого́дой. Она́ захо́дит ко мне в «Неву́». Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9720
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Ма́ша, ты верну́лась! Тебе́ о́чень идёт э́то пла́тье.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:11i9ycx'
    '|b||Спаси́бо! Сейча́с така́я мо́да. Ну, как дела́? Что тут происхо́дит?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5640
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Дела́ иду́т хорошо́. А вре́мя лети́т: ле́то почти́ прошло́!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5400
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||А твой план? Ты всё ещё ду́маешь о своём рестора́не?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3880
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Да. Ме́жду про́чим, пока́ тебя́ не́ было, мне пришла́ в го́лову мысль: он бу́дет на Васи́льевском, ря́дом с на́шими дома́ми.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Отли́чно! Зна́чит, ты не бу́дешь рабо́тать в «Неве́» навсегда́?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4200
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Нет. Я хочу́ идти́ вперёд. Но я здесь уже́ мно́го лет…':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5520
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Всё меня́ется, Том. Ты же никуда́ не уезжа́ешь, ты остаёшься в Петербу́рге!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5760
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Ты права́. Но как сказа́ть О́льге? Не зна́ю, как вы́йти из э́того положе́ния.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6240
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||What does Tom say about Masha''s dress?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2920
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Тебе́ о́чень идёт э́то пла́тье.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2480
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||How are things going at «Нева́»?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2000
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Дела́ иду́т хорошо́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1760
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Where will Tom''s restaurant be?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2360
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||На Васи́льевском, ря́дом с на́шими дома́ми.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||What doesn''t Tom know yet?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2680
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Как сказа́ть О́льге.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2040
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Тебе́ идёт э́то пла́тье: it suits you. Пла́тье не хо́дит! Кому́ идёт? Тебе́, мне, ей: the dative, in the to-colour.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Дела́ иду́т хорошо́: things are going well. Ле́то прошло́: summer is over. Идёт дождь, идёт снег: it''s raining, snowing.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:kyokcl'
    '|a||Вре́мя лети́т: time flies. Вре́мя идёт: time passes. Никто́ не хо́дит и не лета́ет! Mostly the one-way verb: идёт, not хо́дит.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:hzxle4'
    '|a||Одно́ сло́во, два смы́сла. Я иду́ домо́й, а идёт дождь. Самолёт лети́т, и вре́мя лети́т.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1wa2160'
    '|a||Я ношу́ су́мку: I carry. Я ношу́ костю́м: I wear: the habit verb.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:2hm4ps'
    '|a||Я веду́ дете́й в музе́й. А он хорошо́ ведёт себя́: he behaves well.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6520
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:8hhn44'
    '|a||Мне пришла́ в го́лову мысль: an idea came into my head. Пришла́, because мысль is feminine.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:i0p7zl'
    '|a||Положе́ние: a situation. Вы́йти из положе́ния: to find a way out.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:6wvzry'
    '|a||А в кино́ идёт фильм: it''s on. Fixed phrases: learn them whole.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:182mims'
    '|a||Но́вые слова́. Очки́: glasses, always plural: тебе́ иду́т очки́; носи́ть очки́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:k1jvje'
    '|a||Мо́да: fashion. Сейча́с така́я мо́да.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:18evpyg'
    '|a||Что происхо́дит? Произойти́ вы зна́ете: что произошло́?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1c99m9k'
    '|a||Всё меня́ется: everything changes. Возвраща́ться — верну́ться: to come back.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1y62n32'
    '|a||Вперёд: forward. Навсегда́: forever. Надо́лго: for a long time. Ме́жду про́чим: by the way.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:qla1ud'
    '|a||Тепе́рь вы: идёт, иду́т, лети́т или ведёт? Вы́берите.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:18s8xmm'
    '|a||Запо́лните про́пуски.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:cfknag'
    '|a||Опя́ть идёт дождь! Как у тебя́ иду́т дела́?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3640
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Ле́то почти́ прошло́. Как лети́т вре́мя! Ма́льчик пло́хо ведёт себя́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:23lqis'
    '|a||У́тро в «Неве́». По́сле диало́га нажми́те Practise.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1rudfvy'
    '|a||Шесть вопро́сов. Ве́чером звони́т Ма́ша. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:ubw6mj'
    '|b||Том, на у́лице идёт дождь. Пойдём в кино́? Там идёт но́вый фильм.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5360
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:7oyl6b'
    '|a||Пойдём! Но не надо́лго: за́втра я рабо́таю с утра́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4200
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||А я за́втра возвраща́юсь на рабо́ту. Ме́жду про́чим, нача́льница уже́ звони́ла!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5000
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Masha phones Tom. What does she suggest?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3760
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Пойдём в кино́? Там идёт но́вый фильм.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3080
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||When does Masha go back to work?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2480
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||За́втра.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1080
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Вы́берите.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1200
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Тебе́ идёт э́тот стро́гий костю́м. Тебе́ о́чень иду́т очки́. Мне пришла́ в го́лову иде́я.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7440
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Напиши́те по-ру́сски: It has been raining all day.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3840
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Пра́вильно! Весь день идёт дождь.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2800
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Tom: «Не зна́ю, как вы́йти из э́того положе́ния.» What doesn''t he know?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6960
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Вы́йти из положе́ния: to find a way out.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3440
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||6 из 6.':
      mp3: 
