      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:j19hkc'
    '|a||Дела́ иду́т хорошо́. А вре́мя лети́т.':
      mp3: 
