      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Он бу́дет на Васи́льевском, ря́дом с на́шими дома́ми.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3760
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Но как сказа́ть О́льге? Не зна́ю, как вы́йти из э́того положе́ния.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4520
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Идёт дождь, а в кино́ идёт но́вый фильм.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3720
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||А я за́втра возвраща́юсь на рабо́ту.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3040
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Has been raining = идёт: Russian uses the present.':
      mp3: 
